{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gennady \u2014 a hardcore mix of roguelike and platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that dream where you find yourself on a crowded bus wearing nothing but your underwear?<br>Well, this isn\u2019t a bus \u2014 and it\u2019s not a dream either!<br>The blinding light fades, revealing a grim alien meat factory where you must break through compressed biomass with your own body \u2014 not to pay the fare, but to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to hang the twitching remains of vile creatures on the ropes \u2014 those that crawled straight out of the moldy, green-stained pages of this grim comic book.<br>Better finish this quickly\u2026 though sometimes it\u2019s tempting to stay here forever \u2014 or at least for the weekend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn frame-by-frame animation and a high-contrast black-and-white palette tremble under the pressure of pulsating splashes of color that frame this dark pseudo-noir world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/3dbf2987d762b7da899e91a5f3504f35.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/3dbf2987d762b7da899e91a5f3504f35.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to classic brawling, use furious dashes to not only overcome obstacles but also rip local inhabitants to pieces \u2014 turning your body into a living projectile.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/b6c760a6243ccc54e2a3239c7764f9be.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/b6c760a6243ccc54e2a3239c7764f9be.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rage Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a special state of insane speed and deadly attacks, fueled by absolute invulnerability. The better you do at exterminating the local fauna, the longer your rage lasts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/ec2d5d7956692c6de886805eed56cd31.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/ec2d5d7956692c6de886805eed56cd31.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tons of Artifacts and Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade your living currency for artifacts of varying usefulness. Upgrade your character and weapons to create unique builds for more efficient and spectacular gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/2c309605ef01e3eced1e414a342430d6.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/2c309605ef01e3eced1e414a342430d6.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal beasts await you at the end of each biome \u2014 ready to test what you\u2019re truly made of. Literally.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/980b7a9dadac969910fcbf4c8856be61.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/980b7a9dadac969910fcbf4c8856be61.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alley of the Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the rule of permanent death: shoot off your collected artifacts and carry them into your next run \u2014 starting stronger and fully charged.<br>If, of course, you have enough ammo left.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/eb3e8a3af6203dcb52416e288cc7fad4.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/eb3e8a3af6203dcb52416e288cc7fad4.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2430010?t=1769653718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/c64349a458a22817a6cccd22cc7c5b900829a693/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769653718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/483144eecac515783dd2145c6db6ac6a4b957b0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769653718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/483144eecac515783dd2145c6db6ac6a4b957b0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769653718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"In our game, the player can encounter illustrative and stylized scenes of violence, and more specifically: various brutal death scenes, murder with weapons, blood and meat.\r\n\r\nThe story includes reflections on life and death."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2569190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Support us</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/a7f0ee400f314e1688c510c3a2a64f33.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/a7f0ee400f314e1688c510c3a2a64f33.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/a7f0ee400f314e1688c510c3a2a64f33.mp4?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gennady \u2014 a hardcore mix of roguelike and platformer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that dream where you find yourself on a crowded bus wearing nothing but your underwear?<br>Well, this isn\u2019t a bus \u2014 and it\u2019s not a dream either!<br>The blinding light fades, revealing a grim alien meat factory where you must break through compressed biomass with your own body \u2014 not to pay the fare, but to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to hang the twitching remains of vile creatures on the ropes \u2014 those that crawled straight out of the moldy, green-stained pages of this grim comic book.<br>Better finish this quickly\u2026 though sometimes it\u2019s tempting to stay here forever \u2014 or at least for the weekend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Visual Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn frame-by-frame animation and a high-contrast black-and-white palette tremble under the pressure of pulsating splashes of color that frame this dark pseudo-noir world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/3dbf2987d762b7da899e91a5f3504f35.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/3dbf2987d762b7da899e91a5f3504f35.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to classic brawling, use furious dashes to not only overcome obstacles but also rip local inhabitants to pieces \u2014 turning your body into a living projectile.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/b6c760a6243ccc54e2a3239c7764f9be.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/b6c760a6243ccc54e2a3239c7764f9be.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rage Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a special state of insane speed and deadly attacks, fueled by absolute invulnerability. The better you do at exterminating the local fauna, the longer your rage lasts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/ec2d5d7956692c6de886805eed56cd31.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/ec2d5d7956692c6de886805eed56cd31.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tons of Artifacts and Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade your living currency for artifacts of varying usefulness. Upgrade your character and weapons to create unique builds for more efficient and spectacular gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/2c309605ef01e3eced1e414a342430d6.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/2c309605ef01e3eced1e414a342430d6.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal beasts await you at the end of each biome \u2014 ready to test what you\u2019re truly made of. Literally.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/980b7a9dadac969910fcbf4c8856be61.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/980b7a9dadac969910fcbf4c8856be61.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alley of the Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the rule of permanent death: shoot off your collected artifacts and carry them into your next run \u2014 starting stronger and fully charged.<br>If, of course, you have enough ammo left.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/eb3e8a3af6203dcb52416e288cc7fad4.poster.avif?t=1769653718\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/extras/eb3e8a3af6203dcb52416e288cc7fad4.webm?t=1769653718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Feed 64"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430010/dd0707e2947e548a21953275e7d9aa12bb901f95/header.jpg?t=1769653718","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Gennady registered as a trademark and meets all requirements","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430010/923634738/bd3e29672ac9da3ecaadb0a78bb3b615fba269d4/1769067563/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769068241","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430010/923634738/bd3e29672ac9da3ecaadb0a78bb3b615fba269d4/1769067563/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769068241","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430010/923634738/bd3e29672ac9da3ecaadb0a78bb3b615fba269d4/1769067563/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769068241","id":257270002,"name":"Gennady gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257270002/0b48c53f269a9757f70b211f52e2bd223f03a697/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769068241"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430010/721288/20821b0b22c7b7922e812ae7b24368f39aff2da5/1750918578/dash_av1.mpd?t=1719905103","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430010/721288/20821b0b22c7b7922e812ae7b24368f39aff2da5/1750918578/dash_h264.mpd?t=1719905103","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2430010/721288/20821b0b22c7b7922e812ae7b2436